<title>USA: General Scanning not served with suit.</title>
<headline>General Scanning not served with suit.</headline>
<dateline>WATERTOWN, Mass. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Scanning Inc said on Tuesday, in response to press reports, it has not been served with an action from Electro Scientific Industries Inc for alleged patent infringement in the field of memory repair.</p>
<p>The company said it previously studied Electro Scientic's patent claims and was advised by legal counsel that the referenced patents were invalid.</p>
</text>
